[35.688, "o", "{\"answer\":\"The LiveWell guides don't cover this. I'm not a doctor, and I can't recommend a supplement to lower blood sugar. Please speak with a doctor or pharmacist, especially if your blood sugar or screening result is abnormal. Do not stop prescribed treatment without medical advice.\",\"intent\":\"out_of_scope\",\"risk_level\":\"moderate\",\"route\":\"clinician\",\"cited_sources\":[],\"personalisation_flags\":[]}\r\n"]
